
POST {{base_url}}/api/batch/import-books
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456

###
POST {{base_url}}/api/batch/import-csv
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 123456


### 1. 触发一次 CSV 导入作业
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batch/import-csv
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 2. 查询作业执行记录
GET http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/csvImportJob/executions
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 3. 查询步骤详情
GET http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/executions/6/steps
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 4. 查询正在运行的作业
GET http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/csvImportJob/running
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 5. 查询作业实例数量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/csvImportJob/count
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 6. 停止正在运行的作业
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/executions/6/stop
Authorization: Bearer 123456

### 7. 重启失败的作业
POST http://localhost:8080/api/batch/jobs/executions/6/restart
Authorization: Bearer 123456